# Colon-separated SGR sub-parameters. `4:3` selects a curly underline; a parser
# that flattens the colon to a semicolon reads it as `4;3` (underline + italic).
size: 12x2
description: colon SGR sub-parameters do not turn into unrelated attributes

--- input
\e[4:3mA\e[0mB

--- expect-cell
row=0 col=0 underline=true italic=false
row=0 col=1 underline=false italic=false
